    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>This bulky coverall contains a sealed life support system that provides everything the wearer needs to survive for 24 hours in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vacuum\" title=\"Vacuum\">Vacuum</a> of space or any other hostile environment. </p><p>As long as you have life support remaining, you are immune to any atmosphere or inhaled <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a> hazard. The suit also grants a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>. </p>",
